        <li>Reviewed trademark gazettes and trademark classes to identify potential trademark infringement for international clients.</li>
        <li>Collected evidence for potential intellectual property infringement litigation, particularly during license renewal and negotiation.</li>
        <li>Researched intellectual property issues using a range of methods and drafted representation materials for partners.</li>
